          "id": "1630641019556380697",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "He is also a relentless fighter. He has proven in his career he doesn't give up, and fights long after those with less resolve would surrender.\n\nFighters are my favorite people, and they are rare. They also are disproportionately winners—maybe not every fight, but in the long run",
