        {
          "id": "1630641018226786307",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Arun is a dynamic businessperson with a deep understanding for technology. This basic formula describes the leaders of all of the generational tech businesses of our era.\n\nIt's no coincidence, and Arun is right up there based on everyone I've met.\n\nArun is a baller.",
