        {
          "id": "1630641016452595730",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "I feel lucky to have Arun join us in deploying AI across the enterprise and government.\n\nWe are the cusp of one of the most important moments of human history—the AI revolution.\n\nThis will have far-reaching industrial implications—and Arun is the perfect partner for Scale.",
