        "like_count": 148,
        "quote_count": 2,
        "reply_count": 3,
        "retweet_count": 6
      },
      "text": "I'm excited to announce that @acmurthy has joined @scale_AI as Chief Product &amp; Tech Officer.\n\nArun is a founder—he cofounded Hortonworks, helped lead them to IPO, merger with Cloudera, and $5.3B acquisition (one of the largest in enterprise software).\n\n🧵\n\nhttps://t.co/OS5TfPbGm3",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1630641016452595730"
    },
