        "like_count": 1033,
        "quote_count": 18,
        "reply_count": 35,
        "retweet_count": 102
      },
      "text": "the biggest mistake big companies make is thinking most problems can be solved by money\n\nin reality, the best problems can only be solved by blood, sweat, tears, spirit &amp; an overwhelming sense of purpose\n\n“we think about this a lot because it’s not a job, it’s our life”—steve",
