      "text": "There are few feelings as sweet as spending a few hours with someone you feel in your bones you’ll love to work with.\n\nIt’s hard to describe it as anything but magic.\n\nAt the end of the day, it’s always people that make the journey worthwhile.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1629607372032475136"
