      "text": "Today, a senior military official asked me about reinforcement learning with human feedback (RLHF).\n\nThis is awesome—the widespread adoption of RLHF across every industry and use case is critical for the safe, aligned, and useful deployment of AI and LLMs.\n\nRLHF is taking over!",
